@Rag.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5094
# Docker: http://localhost:8080
@documentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ingest a PDF document (adjust the file path to a real PDF)
POST {{Rag.API_HostAddress}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RagBoundary

--RagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../sample.pdf
--RagBoundary--

### List all documents
GET {{Rag.API_HostAddress}}/documents
Accept: application/json

### Get a document by id
GET {{Rag.API_HostAddress}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete a document by id
DELETE {{Rag.API_HostAddress}}/documents/{{documentId}}

### Ask a question
POST {{Rag.API_HostAddress}}/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the standard working week?"
}
